{"id":"n72421-1-7","stage":2,"title":"유난히 · 特别","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72421-1-7-1","ko":"오늘따라 네가 유난히 예뻐 보여.","zh":"你今天看起来格外漂亮。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天","explanation":"오늘：今天；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68207","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"유난히","meaning":"特别，异常，格外","explanation":"유난히：特别，异常，格外","readings":[{"term":"유난히","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72421","senseId":"1","lemma":"유난히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유난히","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3"}},{"text":"예뻐","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예뻐","audio":"/audio/3058984b668d90b33d2b.mp3"}},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여","audio":"/audio/f30cd240679cd06f7fad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68207","definition":"在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"a981b34035c6d45e","term":"유난히","zh":"特别，异常，格外","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3","entryId":"72421","definition":"状态、性格、行为等与平常非常不同地。","pronunciation":["유ː난히"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1f0ef5455aef60b2671c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72421-1-7-2","ko":"오랜만에 화장을 해서 그런가 봐.","zh":"大概因为难得化了妆吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"화장을","meaning":"化妆","explanation":"화장：化妆；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"화장","audio":"/audio/9985ce70b4d09b025063.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87590","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화장을","audio":"/audio/feceddeb51b3ce24fa5d.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"하다：因为，由于；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"18","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"그런가","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":